{"id":17870,"date":"2023-03-01T15:52:49","date_gmt":"2023-03-01T22:52:49","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/?post_type=news&#038;p=17870"},"modified":"2025-04-29T19:22:37","modified_gmt":"2025-04-29T23:22:37","slug":"newsletter-march-2023-vol-3-23","status":"publish","type":"news","link":"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/news-events\/newsletter-march-2023-vol-3-23\/","title":{"rendered":"Newsletter: March 2023 (Vol 3.23)"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-post\" data-elementor-id=\"17870\" class=\"elementor elementor-17870\" data-elementor-post-type=\"news\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-495374c elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"495374c\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;jet_parallax_layout_list&quot;:[]}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-666438c\" data-id=\"666438c\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f77da1b elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"f77da1b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>It&#8217;s hard to believe we&#8217;re almost a quarter of the way into 2023! Here&#8217;s a look back at February (in case you missed anything!) and what Rethink has planned for March.<\/p><h2>We had a blast in San Diego at the ABAI Autism Conference!<\/h2><p>Thanks to everyone who stopped by our booth and joined us for happy hour! We learned so much from the speakers and enjoyed hearing your feedback as well!<\/p><p>One of our highlights? Listening to the panel discussion on <em>Difficult Conversations about ABA as it Relates to Autism Intervention<\/em>.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d6fb228 elementor-blockquote--skin-quotation elementor-blockquote--align-center elementor-blockquote--button-skin-link elementor-blockquote--button-view-icon-text elementor-widget elementor-widget-blockquote\" data-id=\"d6fb228\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"blockquote.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<blockquote class=\"elementor-blockquote\">\n\t\t\t<p class=\"elementor-blockquote__content\">\n\t\t\t\tCuriosity is a powerful tool.\t\t\t<\/p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-q-footer\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<cite class=\"elementor-blockquote__author\">Cole Fitzpatrick, encouraging behavior analysts to continue learning how to make an impact, mainly by providing effective services for adults on the spectrum.<\/cite>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/twitter.com\/intent\/tweet?text=Curiosity+is+a+powerful+tool.+%E2%80%94+Cole+Fitzpatrick%2C+encouraging+behavior+analysts+to+continue+learning+how+to+make+an+impact%2C+mainly+by+providing+effective+services+for+adults+on+the+spectrum.&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com%2Fnews-events%2Fnewsletter-march-2023-vol-3-23%2F\" class=\"elementor-blockquote__tweet-button\" target=\"_blank\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fab fa-twitter\"><\/i>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-blockquote__tweet-label\">Share this<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/blockquote>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-inner-section elementor-element elementor-element-62e74c8 elementor-reverse-mobile elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"62e74c8\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;jet_parallax_layout_list&quot;:[]}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-background-overlay\"><\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-86b9766\" data-id=\"86b9766\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ce2c805 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"ce2c805\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2 style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; color: #ffffff;\">Employee Spotlight<\/h2><h3 style=\"margin-top: 15px; color: #ffffff;\">Fernando Orfila<strong>,<\/strong> <em>VP of Product<\/em><\/h3><p><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><strong>Lives In:<\/strong> Mentally, on a beach paradise&#8230;in reality, Atlanta, GA<br \/><br \/><strong>Family:<\/strong> Toooo many pets\u2026 I think my house can get a tax exemption as an Animal Shelter. My daughters have 3 cats and we have 2 dogs.<br \/><br \/><strong>Favorite food:<\/strong> Ice cream, and my belly can attest to it!<br \/><br \/><strong>Favorite singer\/band:<\/strong> When I was younger, U2. Now I&#8217;m very eclectic.<br \/><br \/><strong>Favorite TV show:<\/strong> Misfits. If you have not seen it, you have to. It is a British dark comedy show (with funky superheroes, or supervillains\u2026 your decision \ud83d\ude09)<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-119bdab\" data-id=\"119bdab\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-